message: "If you use or reference this project, please cite it as below."
title: "斗破苍穹 · AI 命运推演引擎 (Doupo Cangqiong AI Narrative Engine)"
abstract: >-
  A single-file, dependency-free, LLM-driven interactive fiction engine based on
  the Chinese web novel Battle Through the Heavens. It maintains strongly
  consistent structured game state (realm, skills, flames, pills, secret arts)
  on top of unreliable LLM output, using a string-aware JSON extraction chain,
  a guarded state-merge layer, and generation-based race-condition guards for
  background tasks.
